Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:06.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上画出了问题：四个阶段，每个阶段由一个人守着一个终端来跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws the problem: four stages, each run by a person at a terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些步骤怎么执行？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How do we execute these steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个流程能不能自动化？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And can we automate this flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:12.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案是一个编排器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answer is an orchestrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:16.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上用的是 Vertex AI Pipelines，基于 Kubeflow\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture uses Vertex AI Pipelines, on Kubeflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:20.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个教程用的是 SageMaker Pipelines\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This tutorial uses SageMaker Pipelines,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同样是把托管的步骤放进一张图里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same idea of managed steps in a graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:27.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工作流管理按顺序运行这些步骤，让每次运行都可重复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Workflow management runs the steps in order, makes a run repeatable,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:30.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给每一步分配机器，还把过程展示出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}gives each step its machine, and shows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 覆盖了这四项\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repo covers those four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:35.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,调度要等到第 23 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Scheduling waits for lecture 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:38.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且它是托管的：不用你自己运维集群\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And it is managed: no cluster for you to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:42.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,环境设置，第 1 步：clone ml-workflow-aws\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Setup, step 1: clone ml-workflow-aws.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:44.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的 git clone 又是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our git clone is extra again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的目录树显示 src 下面有四个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra tree shows four folders under source:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:49.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个阶段，加上 workflow\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}three stages and the workflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:54.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 到第 5 步都是控制台操作：SageMaker AI 的快速设置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 2 to 5 are console work: quick setup for SageMaker AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:59.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加一个 Unified Studio 域，之后你在那里看 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a Unified Studio domain, where you will watch the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是你的 bucket，和一个用户\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then your bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.45,0:01:04.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,ml-workflow-user，挂了四个策略\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a user named ml-workflow-user, with four policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:10.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为命令行创建一个访问密钥，下载 .csv 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create an access key for the command line, and download the .csv file.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:15.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,快速设置和 Studio 域会留在你的账号里：收尾清理时记得检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Quick setup and the Studio domain stay in your account: check them when you clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:18.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步和第 7 步：安装 AWS CLI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 6 and 7: install the AWS CLI,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:24.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 aws configure，把 .csv 里的两个值贴进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then aws configure, and paste the two values from the .csv.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.51,0:01:28.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这里开始，我们输入的都是明显假的占位符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From here on, we typed obviously fake placeholders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 AWS 回的是真实的报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so AWS answers with real errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:33.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 8 步测试配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 8 tests the configuration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:37.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,AWS 自己拒绝了假的令牌和假的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}AWS itself rejects the fake token and the fake key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你的密钥，这两条会打印出你的账号和你的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With yours, these print your account and your buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:42.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,别急着往下走，等它们打印出来再说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Don't go on until they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.05,0:01:47.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 9 步创建两个角色：CheeseAppSageMakerExecutionRole\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 9 creates two roles: CheeseAppSageMakerExecutionRole,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:51.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给每个任务用；还有 CheeseAppLambdaExecutionRole\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for every job, and CheeseAppLambdaExecutionRole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:56.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码用你的账号 ID 和准确的角色名拼出每个 ARN\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The code builds each ARN from your account number and the exact role name,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以名字要一字不差，在这里暂停一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so spell them exactly, and pause here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据采集器，第 1 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Data collector, step 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:05.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先说一个小疏漏：第 2 部分的四个脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap first: all four part 2 scripts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:09.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,写的都是 README 的 bucket 名，所以每个都要换成你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}name the bucket from the README, so put yours in each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:13.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在这个目录里跑 sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then, in this folder, run sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:18.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥，脚本自己就停了：AWS not configured\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without keys, the script stops itself: AWS not configured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:23.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它 40 秒就构建完，打开一个 root shell。两点说明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it builds in 40 seconds and opens a root shell. Two notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:28.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个脚本为 amd64 构建，Apple Silicon 上要模拟运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This script builds for amd64, which Apple silicon emulates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:31.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Ubuntu 或 Debian 上，sh 就是 dash\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And on Ubuntu or Debian, sh is dash,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:36.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会跳过密钥检查，所以要跑 bash docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which skips the key check, so run bash docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么是一个 shell？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why a shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 entrypoint 脚本里有一个开关\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The entry point script has a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:44.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有参数：它就打开 bash，也就是开发模式，你现在就在这里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No arguments: it opens bash, development mode, where you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:48.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有参数：它就运行它们然后退出，也就是生产模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Arguments: it runs them and exits, production mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:51.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把这叫作可调用的 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture calls that a callable container.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:55.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：search 命令，四种奶酪，每种十张图片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: the search command, four cheeses, ten images each.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:59.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它从网上抓取图片，写出四个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It scrapes the web, writes four folders, zips them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:00.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打成 zip 包，再尝试上传 raw.zip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and tries to upload raw.zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,AWS 拒绝了我们的假密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}AWS rejects our fake key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步，检查你的 bucket，在这里过不去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, check your bucket, cannot pass here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:09.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外列一下目录，磁盘上有 40 张图片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra listing shows 40 images on disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在笔记本上，一个属于 root 的 persistent 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the laptop, a root-owned persistent folder
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:14.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,出现在 clone 下来的 repo 旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}appeared beside the clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:21.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据处理器，第 1 步：arm64 那一行又失败了，同样对调一下就好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Data processor, step 1: the arm64 line fails again, and the same swap fixes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:25.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：python cli.py --clean\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: python cli.py --clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个查重工具检查每个 label\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A duplicate finder checks each label,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:33.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这 40 张里一张重复的都没找到，clean.zip 的上传也失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}finds none among these 40, and the upload of clean.zip fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.41,0:03:34.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:38.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步和第 4 步：检查你的 bucket，然后 --prepare\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 3 and 4: check your bucket, then --prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:44.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,40 张图片全部划分成 32 张训练、8 张验证\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All 40 images split into 32 for training and 8 for validation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,写进两个真实的 TFRecord 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in two real TFRecord files.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上传又失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The upload fails again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:50.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步只能在磁盘上找到它们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 finds them only on disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:54.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的职责卡片都对得上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The duty cards from the lecture match:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:58.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下载，然后验证、去重、转成 TFRecords\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}download, then verify, remove duplicates and convert to TFRecords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:03.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四个 label 就是目录名，也就是你的搜索词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the four labels are just the folder names: your search queries,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要一字不差地输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so type them exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:08.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型训练，第 1 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Model training, step 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:11.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同样是 arm64 那一行，同样对调\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same arm64 line, same swap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:15.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 image 用 commit 过的 lock 文件安装\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This image installs from its committed lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:18.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用的是 SageMaker 版本 2，所以不需要 pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with SageMaker version 2, so it needs no pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步，本地训练\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2, local training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:25.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CPU 上的 TensorFlow 2.20 找到了处理器的 TFRecords\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}TensorFlow 2.20 on the CPU finds the TFRecords from the processor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:27.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,通过共享目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}through the shared folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看最后一层：三个输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at the last layer: three outputs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑了一个 epoch\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One epoch runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的准确率现在还说明不了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its accuracy means nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:39.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后保存失败了：Permission denied，/persistent/model\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then saving fails: Permission denied, /persistent/model.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:41.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里暂停一下，做两处小修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause here for two small fixes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:44.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一处，第 68 行写的是三个类别\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, line 68 says three classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:48.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可数据有四个 label，所以 gouda 没有对应的目标\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}while the data has four labels, so gouda gets no target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:49.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它改成 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Change it to 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:51.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二处，在 Linux 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Second, on Linux, Docker
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:54.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 以 root 身份创建了 persistent 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}created the persistent folder as root,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而这个 container 以 app 用户运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and this container runs as the app user.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:05:01.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出，在你的笔记本上改它的所有者，用卡片上的那条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit, and on your laptop change its owner with the chown command on the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:03.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果是全新 clone 的 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a fresh clone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:07.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第一次跑 docker-shell.sh 之前，自己创建这个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}create the folder yourself before the first docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:09.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后再跑一次第 2 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then run step 2 again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.53,0:05:12.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Mac 上的 Docker Desktop 不会遇到这个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker Desktop on a Mac avoids this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:15.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会写到 /persistent/model/1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It would write to /persistent/model/1:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是你笔记本上的 persistent 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the persistent folder on your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:21.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者训练任务里 SageMaker 的模型目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}or the SageMaker model folder inside a training job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:26.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在保存之前，是课上讲的签名变化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Just before the save sits the signature change from the lecture:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:29.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解码、转换、缩放，都放在模型里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}decode, convert, resize, inside the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:33.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：README 把这件事交给了模型部署\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README gives this job to model deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:35.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其实是训练脚本做的。第 3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The trainer does it. Step 3:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:41.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,sh package-trainer.sh 把 package 目录打包，再拷到 S3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}sh package-trainer.sh packs the package folder and copies it to S3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 tar 文件是真的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tar file is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上传因为我们的假密钥失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The upload fails on our fake key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：python cli.py --train\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: python cli.py --train.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:54.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它问 AWS 你是谁，用来拼出角色的 ARN，然后就停在那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asks AWS who you are, to build the role ARN, and stops there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:57.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它会启动一个训练任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it starts a training job
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:00.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑在 ml.m5.xlarge 上，并且马上返回\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on ml.m5.xlarge, and returns at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:05.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：在控制台里看，Training 下面的 Training jobs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: watch it in the console, under Training, then Training jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的名字以 cheese 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its name starts with cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建并 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Build and push.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:13.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说这一步已经替你做好了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says this step has already been done for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:16.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：workflow 代码拉取的两个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap: the workflow code pulls both images
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:21.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来自你自己账号的 ECR registry，所以你得自己 push，每个一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from the ECR registry of your own account, so you push them yourself, once each.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:26.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这正是课上为自己的 container 列的第二步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is the second step the lecture gives for your own containers:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:29.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 image push 到平台能拉取的 registry\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}push the images to a registry the platform can pull from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:34.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 到第 3 步走 Docker Hub：登录、构建、push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 1 to 3 go through Docker Hub: log in, build, push.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:39.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Mac 那一行构建 amd64，因为 SageMaker 跑的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Mac line builds amd64, because SageMaker runs that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:41.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步设置五个变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 sets five variables.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:45.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照原样贴进去，第一行会打印两个报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pasted exactly as written, the first line prints two errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:50.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 export 不接受那段方括号注释，不过区域还是设上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because export rejects the bracket note, though the region is still set.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:55.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,账号查询因为我们的假密钥失败了，URI 就以一个点开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The account lookup fails on our fake key, and the URI starts with a dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:58.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以只贴值：us-east-1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So paste only the value, us-east-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:03.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你的 URI 以点开头，就说明账号查询失败了：先修好你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And if your URI starts with a dot, the account lookup failed: fix your keys first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:05.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步拉取你的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 pulls your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:11.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步创建仓库，结尾的 || true 把报错藏起来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6 creates the repository, and the || true at the end hides the error:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令以 0 退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the command exits with zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:16.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 到第 11 步：让 Docker 登录 ECR\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 7 to 11 log Docker in to ECR,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.53,0:07:20.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给 image 打 tag，push，列出来，再打印 URI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tag the image, push it, list it, and print the URI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.11,0:07:24.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打 tag 只是给同一个 image 加第二个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tag only adds a second name to the same image.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:27.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的笔记本上跑，别在 workflow container 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run them on your laptop, not in the workflow container,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:29.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那里没有 docker 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which has no docker command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后对数据处理器的 image 再做一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then repeat for the processor image.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:39.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自动化数据采集器，第 1 步，在 workflow 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Automate the data collector, step 1, in the workflow folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:44.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你跑 sh docker-shell.sh 之前，星号的问题又回来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you run sh docker-shell.sh, the "*" problem returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:46.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虽然 commit 了一个 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A lock is committed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:51.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可 Dockerfile 只复制 Pipfile，所以构建会解析出版本 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the Dockerfile copies only the Pipfile, so the build would resolve version 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:53.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查结果显示导入失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The checks show the imports failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:57.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以先做同样的修复：小于 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So make the same fix first: "<3".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跑 sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now run sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:09.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,横幅显示区域和 bucket，身份检查失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The banner shows region and bucket, and the who am I check fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:14.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查：现在是 SageMaker 版本 2，而且没有 docker 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extras: SageMaker version 2 now, and no docker command.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:18.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 的 socket 挂进来了，但里面没有 docker 程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The socket is mounted, but no docker program is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:22.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这里开始，SDK 就是你的遥控器，课上就是这么说的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From here, the SDK is your remote control, as the lecture puts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:26.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 Python 发出请求，AWS 的机器去跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your Python asks, and AWS machines run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:30.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：带上 data collector 参数，跑 python cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: python cli.py --data_collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:32.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它停在第 32 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It stops at line 32,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:37.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那是文件顶部对你账号的一次查询，函数还没开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a lookup of your account at the top of the file, before the function even starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:42.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 CLI 的每个参数，在导入时都需要一个能用的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every flag of this CLI needs a working key at import time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它建一个 processor\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it builds a processor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:48.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你 ECR 里的 image，跑在一台 ml.t3.medium 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from your ECR image, on one ml.t3.medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:52.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 entrypoint 是 python3 加上采集器的 cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its entry point is python3 with the collector cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:57.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后带着搜索参数运行这个任务，一边等一边显示日志\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it runs the job with the search arguments, and waits, showing the logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是生产模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is production mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:03.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker 在参数前面放上它自己的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}SageMaker puts its own command in front of the arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:05.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个 image，同一个 cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same image, same cli.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑在一台你从来不用登录的机器上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on a machine you never log in to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:11.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个任务以角色的身份运行，用的不是你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The job acts as the role, not with your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:16.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：在 Processing 下面的 Processing jobs 里看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: watch it under Processing, then Processing jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:20.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在看整条 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the whole pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件用 Kubeflow 的 DSL 写步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slides write steps in the Kubeflow DSL,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 .output 连起来，再编译成 YAML\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}wired by .output and compiled to YAML.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:31.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里是 SageMaker 的步骤类、属性引用和 JSON\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here: SageMaker step classes, property references and JSON.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先是缓存，30 天\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, caching, for 30 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:38.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一步是一个叫 DataCollector 的处理步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first step is a processing step named DataCollector,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:40.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,声明了一个输出：raw-data\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with one declared output, raw-data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:46.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二步是数据处理器，它的输入是采集器的一个属性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second step, the processor, takes as input a property of the collector:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.47,0:09:48.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 raw-data 输出的 S3 URI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}its raw-data output, S3 URI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是字符串，而是一个引用，它画出一条边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not a string: a reference, and it draws an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:56.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练用同样的方式拿处理器的 TFRecords 输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Training takes the TFRecords output of the processor the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:10:00.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型步骤拿训练出来的模型产物\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the model step takes the trained model artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:02.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个引用都多画出一条边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each reference draws one more edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:08.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，Lambda 步骤 DeployModel，从模型步骤拿模型名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, the Lambda step named DeployModel takes the model name from the model step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:10.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后这个 pipeline 列出全部五个步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the pipeline lists all five steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:13.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从你的笔记本创建负责部署的 Lambda\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}creates the deploy Lambda from your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,upsert 它的定义，再启动它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}upserts its definition, and starts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:18.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:21.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 Pipeline 调用里的步骤列表倒过来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Reverse the list of steps in the Pipeline call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行顺序会变吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Does the run order change?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:37.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会。顺序来自引用：每个输入都指向另一个步骤的输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. The order comes from the references: each input names the output of another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个列表是一组步骤，不是一份时间表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The list is a set of steps, not a schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:46.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外看一样东西，离线生成、从没发出去：SDK 生成的 JSON 定义\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra, built offline and never sent: the JSON definition from the SDK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:50.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个步骤，每条边都是一次 Get，取另一个步骤的某个属性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five steps, each edge a get on a property of another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Upsert 发送的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Upsert sends this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:54.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上画的是四个步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws four steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，部署拆成了两步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, deploy splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:10:59.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CreateModel 创建模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CreateModel makes the model,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而一个 Lambda，也就是 AWS 按需运行的小函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a Lambda, a small function AWS runs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:06.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,负责创建或更新 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on demand, creates or updates the endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:08.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如实说明一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest caveat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:14.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,边决定顺序，但文件也会按固定的名字经过 bucket 传递\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The edges set the order, but files also travel by fixed names through the bucket:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:17.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,raw.zip、clean.zip 和 tfrecords.zip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}raw.zip, clean.zip and tfrecords.zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有账号，我们没法检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We could not check, without an account,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:23.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练任务是怎么在 SageMaker 上找到它的数据的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}how the training job finds its data on SageMaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:29.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：python cli.py --pipeline 停在同样的第 32 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: python cli.py --pipeline stops at the same line 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:32.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它会打印 pipeline 已经启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it prints that the pipeline started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:37.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 upsert 反而因为 Lambda 的运行时失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If instead upsert fails on the Lambda runtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:42.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在 Lambda 调用里把运行时设为 python 3.12，在第 297 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}add runtime="python3.12" to the Lambda call, line 297.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：在 Unified Studio 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: in Unified Studio,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:48.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Build 下面的 ML Pipelines，你会看到这张图\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}under Build, ML Pipelines, you would see this graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:52.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果每一步都成功，缓存会在 30 天内跳过没变的步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If every step succeeds, caching skips unchanged steps for 30 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:55.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以采集器不会再抓取一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the collector won't scrape again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:58.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且绿色的 DeployModel 只说明 Lambda 发出了请求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a green DeployModel only means the Lambda asked:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:01.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要等到 endpoint 进入服务状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}wait until the endpoint is in service.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:05.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步用各自的参数分别测试每个组件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 tests each component with its own flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，四个都停在那一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, all four stop at that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:11.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，模型部署又会建一个新的 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, model deploy makes yet another endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,走之前，先收尾清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you leave, clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:17.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,列出你的 endpoint，全部删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}List your endpoints and delete every one:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:20.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 部分那些带时间戳的，还有 cheese-app-endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the timestamped ones from part 1, and cheese-app-endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后删掉它们的配置和模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then delete their configurations and models.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:26.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,清空并删除两个 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Empty and delete both buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:30.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删除两个 ECR 仓库、负责部署的 Lambda 函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete the two ECR repositories, the deploy Lambda functions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 cheese 的 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the cheese pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:38.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,停用并删除访问密钥，还有不再需要的用户和角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deactivate and delete the access keys, and the users and roles you no longer need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:41.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，检查你创建的两个域\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Finally, check the SageMaker AI domain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:44.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker AI 域和 Unified Studio 域\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the Unified Studio domain you created.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:50.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上最后讲的是一座工厂：你的 Python 是配方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture ends on a factory: your Python is the recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:53.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker Pipelines 来运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and SageMaker Pipelines runs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:57.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的几幅图：笔记本上的一把密钥，云端的一个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today's pictures: a key on the laptop and a role in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:12:59.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,星号不是 pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A star is not a pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:02.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理放在客户端，或者放在模型里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Preprocessing sits in the client or in the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:07.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,站在 endpoint 背后的是三样东西，而引用画出了边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three pieces stand behind an endpoint, and references draw the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在它下面，是用四条命令走完的第 1 部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Under it, part 1 in four commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:15.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 prepare 打包模型，deploy 建出模型、配置和 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prepare packs the model, deploy builds the model, configuration and endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:18.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 predict 发送那些数字，delete 关掉计价器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Predict sends the numbers, and delete turns off the meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:20.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:25.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的笔记本和 endpoint 都会访问 S3：各自用的是哪个身份？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your laptop and the endpoint both reach S3: which identity does each use?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:30.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么选项 2 的 export，永远到不了第 1 部分的 container？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And why do the option 2 exports never reach the part 1 container?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:32.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说出 deploy 创建的三样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Name the three things deploy creates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:36.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一个是地址，哪一个在没人调用时也在计费？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which one is the address, and which one bills while nobody calls it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:39.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理在第 1 部分里放在哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Where does preprocessing sit in part 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:43.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 2 部分的训练脚本里又放在哪里，为什么要挪进模型？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in the part 2 trainer, and why move it into the model?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪几行让训练等着数据处理器？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which lines make training wait for the processor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天需要哪两处一行修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which two one-line fixes did today need,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:51.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Apple Silicon 的 Mac 会跳过哪一处？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and which would an Apple silicon Mac skip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:57.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案在练习里，第 23 讲会从 GitHub 触发这个 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answers are in the exercises, and lecture 23 triggers the pipeline from GitHub.
